try Button

queue Pool [order: Fee]
chain Blocks
ask Name, Fee [into: Pool]
press Build [from: Pool, into: Blocks, take: 2, at: Blocks]

item a [Fee: 3]
item b [Fee: 8]
item c [Fee: 5]

